title: 'Full backlog clearance: Conductor 14-16, Graduation System, Personas CLI, Smart Drift Phase 3'
summary: 'Cleared the entire project backlog in a single session. Conductor v0.15.0 (Sprints 14-16: task lifecycle, active Sentinel, view decomposition — 160 tests). Automation Tier Graduation system (all 4 phases: retroactive graduation, engine with eligibility checking, auto-demotion in stop hook, CLAUDE.md updates — 99% token reduction in compliance overhead). Personas CLI (7 commands closing the gap between 11 MCP tools and 0 CLI). Smart Drift Detection Phase 3 (content fingerprint search with Levenshtein, sliding window, cross-file rename detection). Branch pruning (6 stale branches deleted). Hook source-of-truth discovered and documented (scripts/*.sh → generate-hooks.mjs → plugins/).'
